message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RAIS publications"
abstract: >-
  Embeddable visualisations of the RAIS publications in ERef Bayreuth: a
  semantic map (EmbeddingGemma + UMAP), keyword and co-author networks, and a
  dashboard. A Python pipeline builds a static site, deployed weekly to GitHub
  Pages.
